1 polymer     man 'Soluble cytochrome b562,Mas-related G-protein coupled receptor member X4,Green fluorescent protein' 79795.680 1 
? ? ? 
;The domain (1-8) is corresponding to Flag-tag. The doamin (9-116) is corresponding to Soluble cytochrome b562. The domain (117-438) is corresponding to MRGPRX4 (GenBank: AY042216.1). The domain (439-710) is corresponding to HRV 3C site and GFP.
